{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"I have a strong lead. The International Booker Prize was established in 2005 (2000s). Let me look at the key clue: Chigozie Obioma's novels \"The Fishermen\" (2015) and \"An Orchestra of Minorities\" (2019) were shortlisted for the Booker Prize and translated into 30 languages.\n\nLet me reconsider the structure. The award created in the 2000s could be the Man Booker International Prize (2005). Let me check the winners and look at the connection more carefully. Let me read the Booker Prize page and search for more specific information.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"ref\": \"d40\"}","name":"read"},"id":"call_8114a55af9ca43cdb529d88e","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Man Booker International Prize winners 2016 2017 2018 2019\", \"International Booker Prize winner 2016 The Discomfort of Evening\", \"International Booker Prize 2017 winner Flights Olga Tokarczuk\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_31b81c9a760646edb5766a93","index":1,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789490006,"id":"chatcmpl-207f86c4-bb8c-9928-892d-eee5ae669faa","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":15157,"completion_tokens":200,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":15357,"cached_tokens":9856,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":9856},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}